Package: tellervo-server-db
Version: {{SERVER_VERSION}}
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: tellervo-server-db-pg18 (= {{SERVER_VERSION}}) | tellervo-server-db-pg17 (= {{SERVER_VERSION}})
Suggests: openssh-server, pgadmin3
Replaces: tellervo-server (<= {{SERVER_VERSION}})
Maintainer: Peter Brewer <p.brewer@ltrr.arizona.edu>
Description: PostgreSQL dependency selector for Tellervo server databases
 The Tellervo database package selects an installable PostgreSQL dependency
 bundle for a database host. PostgreSQL 18 is preferred when its PL/Java package
 is available; otherwise apt can fall back to the PostgreSQL 17 bundle.
Distribution: development
